{"articleNo":"200006","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=200006&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"'숲과나눔 인재양성 프로그램' 장학생 모집안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.10.30","hit":"4623","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">'숲과나눔 인재양성 프로그램' 장학생모집&nbsp;계획을 안내해드리니 </span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">해당 학생들의 많은 지원 바랍니다.</span><br><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">1. 신청분야</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; - 석＊박사과정분야</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; - 글로벌리더십분야</span><br><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2.&nbsp;선발대상 및 지원내용&nbsp;: 홈페이지(<a href=\"http://www.koreashe.org/\">www.koreashe.org</a>)참조</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 석＊박사과정분야 : 석＊박사과정 입학 예정자 및 과정생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; - 글로벌리더십분야 : 개발도상국 국적자로 국내대학 석＊박사과정유학</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;예정자 및 유학생</span><br><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">3.&nbsp;신청기간 : 11.19.(월)~12.2.(일) 24:00까지</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">4. 신청접수 :&nbsp;(재)숲과나눔 홈페이지(<a href=\"http://www.koreashe.org/\"><u>www.koreashe.org</u></a>)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">5. 문의처</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">-&nbsp;인재양성 프로그램 담당자 <a href=\"mailto:02-6318-9003/forest@koreashe.org\">02-6318-9003/forest@koreashe.org</a></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
